t catalogue page with campaign artwork, brand system and nutrition panels","fit":"contain","style":{"width":"full"}},{"id":"quencha-can-lineup","type":"image","assetId":"quencha-cans","alt":"The complete six-flavour Quencha can range arranged together on a stone ledge","fit":"contain","style":{"width":"full"}},{"id":"quencha-watermelon-campaign","type":"image","assetId":"quencha-watermelon-poster","alt":"Quencha watermelon campaign poster with the headline Sip Fresh, Enjoy, watermelon slices and a pink poolside scene","fit":"contain","style":{"width":"full"}},{"id":"quencha-store-sign","type":"image","assetId":"quencha-storefront","alt":"Quencha Store illuminated signage mockup with the orange and yellow brand mark","fit":"contain","style":{"width":"full"}},{"id":"quencha-banner-closing","type":"image","assetId":"quencha-banner","alt":"Pink and white Quencha Beverage brand ribbon","fit":"contain","style":{"width":"full"}},{"id":"quencha-brand-applications","type":"image","assetId":"quencha-brand-mockups","alt":"Quencha brand applications across staff polo shirts, a takeaway cup and a shopping bag","fit":"contain","style":{"width":"full"}},{"id":"quencha-thanks-title","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Thank you for watching","style":{"width":"full"}},{"id":"quencha-thanks-copy","type":"text","style":{"width":"full"},"paragraphs":[{"spans":[{"text":"If you want to build your own brand, please click the Create button on the left side of the screen."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Wishing you good health!"}]}]}]}', 1, 'content-import:quencha-v1', '2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z' FROM projects WHERE id = 'quencha-beverage' AND draft_version = 1 AND created_at = '2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z' AND updated_at = '2026-10-12T00:00:00.000Z' ON CONFLICT(id) DO NOTHING;
